{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29684","headline":"房中曲 · 李商隐","name":"房中曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔷薇泣幽素，翠带花钱小。\n娇郎痴若云，抱日西帘晓。\n枕是龙宫石，割得秋波色。\n玉簟失柔肤，但见蒙罗碧。\n忆得前年春，未语含悲辛。\n归来已不见，锦瑟长於人。\n今日涧底松，明日山头檗。\n愁到天池翻，相看不相识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}